{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling: the operator ambient git environment (GIT_COMMON_DIR, GIT_DIR, GIT_WORK_TREE, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL, GIT_CONFIG_SYSTEM, the GIT_CONFIG_* family, HOME, XDG_CONFIG_HOME) is out of the gitseq threat model. gitseq trusts the environment of the operator who runs it; defending a hostile operator-controlled environment is a non-goal. This corrects my terse yes at seq 13524. Request d2605fd7 closes as documented-not-defended: record this trust assumption in the threat-model documentation; do not strip the env family."}